    {
      "name": "Request card",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "request-card",
      "description": "Thin-bordered approval request with a secondary action.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-request\"><h4>Благодарность</h4><p>На согласовании · 100 баллов</p><p>Баллы в резерве. Заявка не является разрешением.</p><button class=\"ds-button ds-quiet\">Отменить заявку</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-button{display:inline-flex;justify-content:center;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:12px 18px;min-height:44px;border-radius:9px;background:var(--panel,#11262f);color:var(--ink,#edf5f2);border:1px solid var(--line,#29404a);font-size:13px;font-weight:700;line-height:1.65;cursor:pointer;transition:background .18s,transform .18s;font-family:Manrope,Segoe UI,sans-serif;}.ds-button:hover{background:#203c47}.ds-button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--gold,#f0ca7a);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-button:disabled{cursor:not-allowed;opacity:.5}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-button{transition:none}}.ds-request{padding:14px;border:1px solid var(--line,#29404a);border-radius:12px;color:var(--ink,#edf5f2);background:var(--bg,#08151c);max-width:340px;font-family:Manrope,Segoe UI,sans-serif;}.ds-request h4{font-size:13px;margin:0 0 5px}.ds-request p{font-size:12px;line-height:1.65;color:var(--muted,#acc0c6);margin:5px 0}.ds-request .ds-button{margin-top:12px;padding:8px 11px;font-size:12px}.ds-quiet{background:transparent}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Team progress",
      "kind": "custom",
      "refersTo": "team-progress",
      "description": "Shared progress with a turquoise bar and compact line illustration.",
      "html": "<section class=\"ds-mission\"><h4>Общий результат</h4><strong>22 / 40</strong><p>Подтверждённые результаты команды</p><div class=\"ds-progress\"><span></span></div><svg viewBox=\"0 0 300 58\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M0 49h300M22 49V25h46v24M80 49V13h52v36M145 49V20h62v29M223 49V6h52v43\"/></svg></section>",
      "css": ".ds-mission{background:#17332f;padding:15px;border-radius:12px;max-width:340px;color:var(--ink,#edf5f2);font-family:Manrope,Segoe UI,sans-serif;}.ds-mission h4{margin:0 0 4px;font-size:13px}.ds-mission strong{font-size:20px;color:var(--mint,#70e1c2);font-weight:650}.ds-mission p{color:#b4d1c8;font-size:11px;line-height:1.65;margin:0}.ds-progress{height:5px;background:#315047;border-radius:5px;margin:13px 0 7px;overflow:hidden}.ds-progress span{display:block;width:55%;height:100%;background:var(--mint,#70e1c2);transition:width .7s cubic-bezier(.16,1,.3,1)}.ds-mission svg{width:100%;height:58px;margin-top:6px;stroke:#80cdb9;stroke-width:1;fill:none}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-progress span{transition:none}}"
    },
